#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clicking with the &LMB; on the &kruler; will turn the cursor to a cross with four arrows and enables you to drag &kruler; around the screen."
msgstr "Ao premer &kruler; co &LMB; o cursor tórnase unha cruz con catro frechas que permiten arrastrar &kruler; pola pantalla."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "When you move the mouse over &kruler;, your cursor will turn into a red arrow. As you move the cursor, &kruler; will display how far from the origin the cursor currently is."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can resize the ruler by moving the mouse over the handle on the left or right edges of &kruler; (the top or bottom edges when it is oriented vertically), holding down the &LMB; and dragging the handle."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:85
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "You can change the orientation in three different ways:"
msgid "You can change the orientation in two different ways:"
msgstr "Pódese cambiar a orientación de tres maneiras distintas:"

#. Tag: member
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clicking the &MMB; switches the ruler from vertical to horizontal orientation"
msgstr "Premendo o &MMB; cambia a regra da orientación vertical á horizontal"

#. Tag: member
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the context menu, described in the next chapter"
msgstr "Usando o menú de contexto, que se describe no seguinte capítulo"

